<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερτρέχω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δρᾰμοῦμαι,</span> and in <i><span class="en">
			Philetaer.
			3
		</span></i> (s. v.l.) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δραμῶ</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έδρᾰμον</span>: cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερθέω</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>run over</i> or <i>beyond, outrun, escape from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκρην πενίην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					620
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prevail against,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥστε . . θεῶν νόμιμα . . θνητὸν ὄνθ᾽
					ὑπερδραμεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					455
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶς τὰ κρείσσω θνητὸς οὖσ᾽
					ὑπερδράμω;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					973
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hel.</u>
				1524
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν δ᾽ αὖ κρατηθῆς καὶ τὰ
				τοῦδ᾽ ὑπερδράμῃ</span> if . . his fortune <i>prevail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				578
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>excel, surpass,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ θεὰς ὑπερδράμοι κάλλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					930
				</span></i>
			, cf. Philetaer.l.c.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
